    "semanticRules": [
      "Foundation-only lifecycle",
      "`incident_key=SHA-256(JCS({owner_domain,process_type,work_kind,error_code,resource_scope_key?}))`，其中可选`resource_scope_key`不新增列，只能来自该Work实际冻结/使用的Permit、typed Resource Demand及`fx_event_resource_timings`并冻结在identity/circuit digest",
      "无法精确归因时省略该值并保持process-local",
      "同一terminal Work occurrence重复观察不增加计数，新的occurrence以CAS单调增加，达到3次时打开exact-scope Circuit",
      "首个命中scope的新Work获得`open → recovering`资格，只有其实际成功经过的同一process/resource path invariant evidence才允许`recovering → resolved`并关闭对应Circuit",
      "Domain只能读取Incident ref/projection，不得控制其生命周期",
      "`INDEX(incident_state,last_seen_at_ms)`"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`incident_key PK, owner_domain, process_type, work_kind, error_code, occurrence_count, circuit_key, incident_state(open|recovering|resolved), evidence_digest, first_seen_at_ms, last_seen_at_ms, resolved_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "Foundation-only lifecycle；`incident_key=SHA-256(JCS({owner_domain,process_type,work_kind,error_code,resource_scope_key?}))`，其中可选`resource_scope_key`不新增列，只能来自该Work实际冻结/使用的Permit、typed Resource Demand及`fx_event_resource_timings`并冻结在identity/circuit digest；无法精确归因时省略该值并保持process-local；同一terminal Work occurrence重复观察不增加计数，新的occurrence以CAS单调增加，达到3次时打开exact-scope Circuit；首个命中scope的新Work获得`open → recovering`资格，只有其实际成功经过的同一process/resource path invariant evidence才允许`recovering → resolved`并关闭对应Circuit；Domain只能读取Incident ref/projection，不得控制其生命周期；`INDEX(incident_state,last_seen_at_ms)`"
    },
